  "description": "With the start of senior year, high schooler Lee Yoeng-Won can't wait to graduate and leave his life of poverty behind. He only has to focus on studying so he can get into a good college. But suddenly, Mr. Popular, Yu Seon-U, who was never close to Yeong-Won, starts buying him food, helps him become class president, and even walks him home. Though Yeong-Won knows his top priority should be his grades, he begins to wonder why Seon-U is always the subject of his gaze...\n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
